    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">THEOLOGICAL SEMINARY <lb/><rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__943" type="place">ALEXANDRIA</rs>, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__944" type="place">VIRGINIA</rs>
                        <lb/></fw><fw place="left">REV. <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3718"
                            type="person">A. T. MOLLEGEN</rs>
                        <lb/>DEPARTMENT OF <lb/>CHRISTIAN ETHICS</fw>
                    <dateline><date when="1946-08-10">Aug. 10, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Since I am in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__944" type="place">North Carolina</rs>
                    and have no idea where you are I am starting my birthday greetings to you ten
                    days early.</p>
                <p>It was a great day 60 years ago for the Church, the world and me. I sincerely
                    thank God for your birth and<pb n="2"/> shall continue to pray for your life and
                    work. And these are far from being pious utterances.</p>
                <p>If I were God, I would keep you here until your Systematic Theology was published
                    in full at the very least.</p>
                <closer><salute>Sincerely,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3718"
                            type="person">AT Mollegen.</rs>
                        <lb/>Chaplain</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
